  "explicit_non_claims": [
    "The evaluator compares paired measured summaries and does not implement a packet scheduler.",
    "A paired-trial PASS is not programme-level statistical qualification.",
    "No claim is made that the legacy DaMPS/CaDaMPS repository is the exact source behind the 2026 journal paper.",
    "Paper-reported performance percentages are not directly comparable without matched workloads and baselines.",
    "A literature-only comparator is not an executed experiment.",
    "Late useful bytes are not counted as on-time useful payload.",
